    "changelog": "First release. A desk companion with a face that blinks, drifts and reacts to touch, a seven segment clock synced over SNTP, a focus timer that the face watches with you, nine internet radio stations, five public domain speeches, and Bluetooth audio out to earphones or a speaker. Swipe between pages or let them turn on their own. Core board only, nothing to attach."
